<section class="privacy-policy">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>

    <p>Welcome to our website. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information collected and received from your use of our website.</p>

    <h2>2. Information Collection</h2>

    <p>We do not collect personal information about our visitors. The site has no forms, analytics, tracking or third-party embeds. Like every web host, our hosting provider processes your IP address to deliver the pages.</p>

    <h2>3. Use of Cookies</h2>

    <p>This site sets no cookies. Your light or dark theme choice is stored in your browser's localStorage and never leaves your device.</p>

    <h2>4. Data Security</h2>

    <p>We take data security seriously and ensure reasonable steps to protect your information. However, no internet transmission is entirely secure, and we cannot guarantee the security of data transmitted to our site.</p>

    <h2>5. Third-Party Websites</h2>

    <p>Our website may contain links to other websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of such other websites.</p>

    <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>

    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. We encourage you to review this policy occasionally to stay informed about how we are protecting the information we collect.</p>

    <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>

    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at pa-tech@gmail.com.</p>
</section>

